        "tier": "measurable",
        "claim": "Local councils already spend \u00a32.3 billion on temporary accommodation annually \u2014 2.4 times more per household than national government spends on housing benefit.",
        "evidence_id": "E39",
        "quote": "Local councils spent \u00a32.3 billion on temporary accommodation in 2024-25, which is 2.4 times more per household than the national government spends on housing benefit."
      },
      {
